[SIZE="4"][B]Bug reports[/B][/SIZE]

Include your firmware version, how you entered recovery, what you did, and [I]/tmp/recovery.log[/I] (adb pull /tmp/recovery.log). Do not report issues from Snapdragon G2 Mini models.

